A||||12||WhiteFieroBlur||first rejection at a shop||||8||
Z||000000||WhiteFieroBlur||10-17-2001||01:34 PM||||Well i am at the upholstry shop buying some vinyl and after I am done I spot a muffler shop next door which I thought was closed down. So I am all happy and wanting to go over there to see if they are cheaper than the others. so I go in there and there are these two guys. So I tell one about how I got a fiero and would like some estimates on instillation so the guy said go to that guy over there, so I walk over and he asks what kinda car again? I said a fiero. he tells me right away he won't work on it. I then told him about how I will buy the part custom for the fiero which will fit right in with the old. He tells me nope! I will not work on a fiero. Well I just walked away with a sad face, I wanted to cuss him out. When I do get my exhasut finally done I should go by his shop and rev up and peel out. But for real, how you gonna just reject a customer like that and not wanna make some money.<P>  People are so scared about woking on a fiero. I mean you got a shop, your suppose to be the expert. I am thinking of going with the spin tech from fiero west. I want the loudest exhaust I can get but powerfull and deep sounding. So I am still looking kinda.||||reg||8
