Z||000005||Voytek||10-17-2001||02:15 PM||||If they won't work on a Fiero, they probably shouldn't be in business.  Fieros are some of the easier cars to work on.<P>I'm sure you're better off this way.<P>I've been told the same thing by a fairly popular garage chain in town.  I haven't been back since.<P>Yes, I DO think you should get it somewhere else and go back to show them.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
